      "description": "<p>Justice department detained James Codey Bryant and allege he offered ‘technical advice’ to primary suspect</p><p>A surprise suspected accomplice has been arrested in connection with a mass school shooting in Canada that was made notorious after an 18-year-old allegedly killed six children after discussing it with the AI chatbot ChatGPT.</p><p>The US Department of Justice said Tuesday it had detained James Codey Bryant, 30, a resident of western Washington state, on a charge of conspiracy to murder persons in a foreign country.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/06/tumbler-ridge-shooting-arrest-washington\">Continue reading...</a>",
